{"v":4,"catch":"Word in Word 是一款從 1000 多個單詞謎題中收集單詞的遊戲。","desc":"Word in Word 是許多人從小就熟悉的單詞收集遊戲。 從 1000 多個字謎中獲得智力樂趣並造字。\n此外，在特殊模式下，您將與電腦對手競爭。 升級你的等級，成為冠軍。\n在特殊的“決鬥”模式下與您的朋友在同一個控制台上玩。 檢查誰是最聰明和最快的單詞搜索！\n\n因此，繼續尋找單詞並成為出色的單詞查找者！\n\n特徵：\n• 大量的單詞\n• 放鬆冥想遊戲\n• 在本地模式下與朋友一起玩\n• 每個詞的簡要說明\n• 隨心玩，支持觸屏","publisher":"17Studio","release":"2023-02-02","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","派對","學習"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["英文","俄文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/09ed0c8f37dc648c6738995bc82d7664d4aed6436d2187d38e272dedce5741b3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fae26fde2c9a5adf1cf7bd30462bdb33c02a1d791350305749dc19fb01488135.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/13c939f82fe3d0ea6ca786b579678341c19ac4f2136dcdd2ea94d09c187237ae.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0e28b6c7cd741451bddbc3514e7924d2e9a0bfb62c6adc232c040af9c21a67a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54ea4d601ab27d9775284851d494c6d332c501c6ef8eceb0892078c19496783d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d7444398e4554850ffb078ea5e4e0a55d36f58fcb65b7b8a5341d3053af63d6.jpg"],"titleId":"010023d019f72000","dlc":[]}